  abilityDesc: Massive Earth attack on single foe, 3 combo massive Earth attack on
    single foe (damage relative to remaining HP), greatly boosts own Atk, Def, Rec
    for 3 turns, hugely boosts Earth, Dark elemental damage for 3 turns, probable
    huge 1 turn Atk reduction & powerful additional damage at turn's end for 1 turn
